  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mi>h</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>k</mi><mo>)</mo></math> be the intersection of the two given lines its equidistant from both axes.</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><mi>h</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><mi>k</mi></mfenced></math></p><p>Since it lies in the fourth quadrant, the point can be written as <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mi>h</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mi>h</mi><mo>)</mo></math>, where <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>h</mi><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>0</mn></math>.</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mi>h</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mi>h</mi><mo>)</mo></math> lies on both the lines.</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>a</mi><mi>h</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>a</mi><mi>h</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>=0</mo></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;&#160;</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>a</mi><mi>h</mi></math>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>h</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>c</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>a</mi></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>5</mn><mi>b</mi><mi>h</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>b</mi><mi>h</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>d</mi><mo>=0</mo></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;&#160;</mo><mi>d</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>b</mi><mi>h</mi></math>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>h</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>d</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>b</mi></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>c</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>a</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>d</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>b</mi></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>b</mi><mi>c</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>a</mi><mi>d</mi><mo>=0</mo></math></p>",
